{"suttaId":"tha-ap472","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1486,1533],"vripara":"59"},"segments":{"tha-ap472:0.3":"Nimittabyākaraṇiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap472:1.1":"“Ajjhogāhetvā himavaṃ, mante vāce mahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap472:1.3":"Catupaññāsasahassāni, sissā mayhaṃ upaṭṭhahuṃ.","tha-ap472:2.1":"“Adhitā vedagū sabbe, chaḷaṅge pāramiṃ gatā;","tha-ap472:2.3":"Sakavijjāhupatthaddhā, himavante vasanti te.","tha-ap472:3.1":"“Cavitvā tusitā kāyā, devaputto mahāyaso;","tha-ap472:3.3":"Uppajji mātukucchismiṃ, sampajāno patissato.","tha-ap472:4.1":"“Sambuddhe upapajjante, dasasahassi kampatha;","tha-ap472:4.3":"Andhā cakkhuṃ alabhiṃsu, uppajjantamhi nāyake.","tha-ap472:5.1":"“Sabbākāraṃ pakampittha, kevalā vasudhā ayaṃ;","tha-ap472:5.3":"Nigghosasaddaṃ sutvāna, ubbijjiṃsu [vimhayiṃsu (syā. ka.)] mahājanā.","tha-ap472:6.1":"“Sabbe janā samāgamma, āgacchuṃ mama santikaṃ;","tha-ap472:6.3":"Vasudhāyaṃ pakampittha, kiṃ vipāko bhavissati.","tha-ap472:7.1":"“Avacāsiṃ [vidassāmi (syā.)] tadā tesaṃ, mā bhetha [mā roda (ka.), mābhāyittha (syā.)] natthi vo bhayaṃ;","tha-ap472:7.3":"Visaṭṭhā hotha sabbepi, uppādoyaṃ suvatthiko [sukhatthiko (syā.)].","tha-ap472:8.1":"“Aṭṭhahetūhi samphussa [aṭṭhahetūhi samphassa (syā. pī.), atthahetu nisaṃsayaṃ (ka.)], vasudhāyaṃ pakampati;","tha-ap472:8.3":"Tathā nimittā dissanti, obhāso vipulo mahā.","tha-ap472:9.1":"“Asaṃsayaṃ buddhaseṭṭho, uppajjissati cakkhumā;","tha-ap472:9.3":"Saññāpetvāna janataṃ, pañcasīle kathesahaṃ.","tha-ap472:10.1":"“Sutvāna pañca sīlāni, buddhuppādañca dullabhaṃ;","tha-ap472:10.3":"Ubbegajātā sumanā, tuṭṭhahaṭṭhā ahaṃsu te.","tha-ap472:11.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ nimittaṃ viyākariṃ;","tha-ap472:11.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, byākaraṇassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap472:12.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap472:13.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap472:14.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap472:15.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā nimittabyākaraṇiyo thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap472:16.1":"Nimittabyākaraṇiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap472:17.1":"Sālakusumiyavaggo sattacattālīsamo.","tha-ap472:18.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap472:19.1":"Sālakusumiyo thero, pūjā nibbāpakopi ca;","tha-ap472:19.3":"Setudo tālavaṇṭī ca, avaṭalabujappado.","tha-ap472:20.1":"Pilakkhapaṭibhānī ca, veyyākaraṇiyo dijo;","tha-ap472:20.3":"Dvesattati ca gāthāyo, gaṇitāyo vibhāvibhi."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
